{"title":"1984 BMO","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>1984 BMO</b> problems and solutions. The 1st BMO was held in Athens, Greece in 1984.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1984 BMO Problems (page does not exist)\">1984 BMO Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1984 BMO Problems/Problem 1\"> Problem 1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1984 BMO Problems/Problem 2 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1984 BMO Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1984 BMO Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\"> Problem 4</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1984_BMO&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_Mathematical_Olympiad\" title=\"Balkan Mathematical Olympiad\">Balkan Mathematical Olympiad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Balkan_MO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" title=\"Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">Balkan MO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions\">Mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title